如月 つぐみ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An amnesiac optimist whose favorite phrase is \"Everything will work out.\" People naturally gather around him because he treats everyone fairly and he has a caring personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of his background, he doesn't usually doubt people. He's a good-natured person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Was there a trauma that preceded his amnesia?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c114669"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e5b022ee933e37f6ead061a79dede0d6d7f5579861ea15431d36e11d838075d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a9e28397324d003641a573fb482a25a98fe96b8500e0b881ec0dbdf5ec547298.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"薄墨 桜","creatorId":"vndb:s28833","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28833","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28833","name":"薄墨 桜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:89345","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c115146","characterName":"朝岡 蓮","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c115146"},"originalCharacterName":"朝岡 蓮","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A boy who tried \"Urban Legend of the Doppelganger\" in the form of dating a friend and gained a special ability. After meeting the protagonist by chance and helping him and Shirasaki out of the blue, he is pushed around by both of them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has high communication skills, can get along with even the older Sakakura, and is straightforward and unwavering."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although he is a cheerful, single-minded idiot, he seems to have his own thoughts about his uncertain future and his mother's remarriage."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from offiical website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c115146"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/17c26ea0181d9f20e7c0587a3c762d3c1b489bad4af07ca02d2a4840941d3b9f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e2cb271e06f59b9d4fdaf5f70d1a854d97e0ac86d4715a4d9885264448ad146f.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"環 玲美","creatorId":"vndb:s12382","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12382","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12382","name":"環 玲美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:89335","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c115147","characterName":"白崎 茉莉花","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c115147"},"originalCharacterName":"白崎 茉莉花","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who gained unusual powers by trying out the urban legend her classmates told her about. When she was attacked by a black mist monster, the protagonist and Asaoka saved her. Since then, she has been devoted to the protagonist like a loyal dog."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is known on campus as a beautiful prodigy, but her cold attitude toward others and her appearance make her difficult to approach."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is blunt and sharp-tongued when dealing with people she is not used to dealing with."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c115147"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/75b167c1f06d5065d2485ac76347c4b758e4581dee7342cbae1e246f57420362.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a0619c034587b8f12ebc67493f2e482afba5d7fa9c964fed78abf4a14ccabc58.webp","width":193,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"イヅカ","creatorId":"vndb:s17606","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17606","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17606","name":"イヅカ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:89336","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c115148","characterName":"坂倉 出","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c115148"},"originalCharacterName":"坂倉 出","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"28"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An unsuccessful mystery writer who discovers that the protagonist has amnesia. He also works as an occult researcher. He is not satisfied with the fact that his name is well-known, as he has appeared on TV."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's a weirdo who can't hide his shadiness, but as a mystery writer, his deductive powers are remarkable, and he has a wealth of knowledge."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is also a skillful speaker who can convince people, and is relied upon as a guardian. However, he still acts suspicious."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c115148"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4fcffdf69cdadcb240243f3a158815ff677f21ed36521f940db965f413cae0eb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b8d264ea5d03d4c8a42144bb542c1c2cfb9f7ab58ab67fd69be04b3e7ea74e8f.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"橘 怜侍","creatorId":"vndb:s28834","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28834","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28834","name":"橘 怜侍","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:89346","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c115149","characterName":"大神 律","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c115149"},"originalCharacterName":"大神 律","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a talented gamer who hangs out at the \"Plum Club\" video game arcade, where the main character works part-time. He is isolated on campus because of his delinquent appearance and bad behavior. However, he is misunderstood because of his poor language skills, and he is aware of this."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After losing his mother and living in a single-father household, his relationship with his father deteriorated due to living apart from each other."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He dislikes Ren, but it's not just because he dislikes him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c115149"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/ba99d48428da48a879a3bafea9285adb99cbfb88403afd853003c6d784aba7a2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a6/a68137a56ad2556349fedf75e1435b4ff02470c21ec87c2fe032a29e3033ee46.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐藤 うり","creatorId":"vndb:s28835","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28835","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28835","name":"佐藤 うり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:89348","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"白金 うずく","creatorId":"vndb:s28836","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28836","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28836","name":"白金 うずく","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:89349","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c115150","characterName":"紺野 美弥子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c115150"},"originalCharacterName":"紺野 美弥子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who belonged to the same special course as Shirasaki, but stopped attending school because she couldn't stand being bullied."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was rumored to have gone missing after trying out an urban legend, but one day she suddenly started coming to school without anything happening."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She seems so cheerful and positive that it is hard to believe that she was bullied, but she also has a somewhat dark and idealistic view of things."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c115150"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/ab1eb79d580410f2675479ce92b45910eab262cd052d84fe04bb628cdea3e637.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df2dea3862ba750510de4a16477e5c90d1220b2ea07976c7e64cc3b20c283268.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"夜宵 紫苑","creatorId":"vndb:s21493","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21493","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21493","name":"夜宵 紫苑","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:89339","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c115151","characterName":"霧島 頼人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c115151"},"originalCharacterName":"霧島 頼人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"27"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the leader of \"Unknown,\" an organization that privately manages supernatural powers and solves cases related to supernatural powers. He is a cool, hard-nosed man with a sweet tooth."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He developed a cure for an intractable disease several years ago and became the man of the hour as a genius researcher, but has since disappeared."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Currently, he has cut ties with \"Aoba Holdings,\" a company that has been abusing his abilities, and is conducting research and other activities related to his abilities at Unknown. He is in pursuit of a person who has the ability to use the black fog and a person who betrayed Unknown."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c115151"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/abe9a27195a5a97b70c1f2818ce50cad4db846946ed5a55a06d93bb8ecae7051.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4a0248507b0e3ae8f86c42c78de6264fa5660649947e7e006e28e2e79c64230.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"宮司道 章造","creatorId":"vndb:s28837","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28837","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28837","name":"宮司道章造","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:89350","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c115152","characterName":"篠塚 撫子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c115152"},"originalCharacterName":"篠塚 撫子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"21"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the signature waitress at the \"Snowflake\" coffee shop. She is quite stylish, but tends to be mistaken as a minor because of her childish face. She also works at a sister cafe."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In general, she does not get involved in other people's lives more than necessary and tries to keep her distance from everyone. She coldly rejects anyone who tries to overstep her boundaries, and she is merciless with her signature venomous tongue."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For some reason, she treats the protagonist in a friendly manner, making him a person of great mystery. Her treatment of Sakakura, a regular at the coffee shop, is a far cry from the way she treats him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c115152"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/02a16b7df1ba29a0c639eba3af66f1ce0a180bd5e914092225089f8ca992fa24.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c5cf3f23bd77e8bc4239f03d07d01956b6a97d32c91bcf283789647e221d08b9.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"梨の助","creatorId":"vndb:s28521","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28521","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28521","name":"梨の助","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:89343","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c115153","characterName":"宗形 樹","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c115153"},"originalCharacterName":"宗形 樹","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"23"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a senpai clerk at \"Plum Club,\" a video game arcade where the protagonist works part-time. He is a womanizer, and is always being warned by the protagonist, who is his kouhai, for hitting on female customers and staff."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a charismatic man who is mischievous but somehow still lovable. Although he is not a good worker, he is good at his job and is amiable, which makes his job run smoothly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although he looks like a simple man, he seems to be sharp and occasionally makes good points."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c115153"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/3652fe8f42b3c3124543db79c45efdbd82131d6c4d35659ccc801b9bacfd8187.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f1/f10ffa7440887c94adaa27d6c64952884ecdd6c9f7f5ad1af595e35517138dc8.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"栂井 栄人","creatorId":"vndb:s1390","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1390","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1390","name":"栂井 栄人","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:89341","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"滝代 椿","creatorId":"vndb:s28838","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28838","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28838","name":"滝代 椿","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:89351","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c115154","characterName":"宇津呂木 すず","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c115154"},"originalCharacterName":"宇津呂木 すず","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An ability user protected by \"Unknown.\" She is a selfish, spoiled girl on the inside, but is disguised as a beautiful, light-skinned woman. She also has a bad mouth."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Like a wild animal, she instinctively senses danger and popularity and is good at running away."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She does not listen to others and does not trust people easily, but she is friendly to those she likes and acts like a big sister to younger people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c115154"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/27/278978b36bb36683b07a26978d7682e20959d647632586d821688e9c2917999e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0beaeda871101798c7f48e3ac9c141c34424a905feb888468a5d8a47b8c14aab.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"乃花 こより","creatorId":"vndb:s20005","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s20005","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s20005","name":"乃花 こより","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:89338","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c115155","characterName":"芹澤 香澄","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c115155"},"originalCharacterName":"芹澤 香澄","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A polite half-Japanese girl who attends an art school. She is a genius artist that has won prizes in competitions and has synesthesia that makes her sense taste in colors. Her grandfather is the former owner of the coffee shop \"Snowflake.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a high school student, although her childish appearance does not show it, and she hates to be ridiculed for this, along with the fact that she is half-Japanese."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is currently in a slump and is losing confidence as well as her taste buds."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c115155"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fb3e250a1f29b02d254fe51c1591eca9944803ceea92731f3754be6ae865e323.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2ebb03c2b38f700d9cd04308cbc54c5b71b935b5070aa4b5785e428a604a0a23.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"南原 光香","creatorId":"vndb:s17649","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17649","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17649","name":"南原 光香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:89337","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c115156","characterName":"朝岡 晴子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c115156"},"originalCharacterName":"朝岡 晴子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is Ren's caring older sister. At first glance, she appears to be an enchanting and beautiful woman with a mature and sexy personality, but she is just like her brother in the way she takes an interest in things."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is an accomplished woman outside the house, but once she returns home, she transforms into a lazy older sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was quite a delinquent when she was a student, and because of the trouble she caused, she is cooperating with her mother's remarriage."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c115156"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2e7cf0582efe19e4737224419af8bce34c1a3a4de4d524c095ec3472962372cb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8ece7635792575f124556e93f9b4f03a5a909efc39dfb95386af688a7b6693fe.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朝富 やくも","creatorId":"vndb:s28839","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28839","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28839","name":"朝富 やくも","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:89352","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c115157","characterName":"皆川 恭介","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c115157"},"originalCharacterName":"皆川 恭介","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","st